        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for IBA‑approved billing when shifting from Gandhi Nagar to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government‑issued ID, the original GST registration certificate of the mover, a signed service agreement, and a detailed inventory list. For corporate moves, include the company’s PAN and a reimbursement authorization letter. These documents guarantee compliance with IBA standards.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are the vehicles used for my move GPS‑tracked and how does that benefit me?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every Shree Ashirwad truck is equipped with real‑time GPS tracking. This allows you to monitor the exact location of your shipment, receive live ETA updates, and ensures accountability throughout the 1499 km journey from Gandhi Nagar Dumka to Mumbai.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure zero damage to fragile items during a Gandhi Nagar relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 4‑Protocol Zero‑Damage Execution System employs 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging, custom wooden crates for glass and temple items, and trained handling crews. Each fragile piece is labeled, wrapped, and secured with high‑tensile ratchet lashings before being placed in GPS‑monitored containers.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I ship my two‑wheel vehicle along with household goods from Gandhi Nagar to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. We provide dedicated two‑wheel carriers with hydraulic loading ramps, wheel chocks, and reinforced tie‑downs. Your bike or scooter travels in a separate enclosed trailer, fully insured and tracked, while your household items occupy the main container trucks.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included for a Gandhi Nagar to Mumbai move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All moves include IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering 100 % of the declared value of your goods. You can also opt for higher coverage limits. The policy protects against loss, theft, or damage during loading, transit, and unloading.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the typical 5‑stage relocation workflow take for a move from Gandhi Nagar, Dumka?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 5‑stage workflow—pre‑survey, packing, loading, transit, and unpacking—usually spans 7‑10 days for a three‑bedroom home, depending on inventory size and traffic conditions. Each stage is scheduled in advance, and our team provides daily status updates to keep you informed.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
